===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:chapitre|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|chapitre}}, from {{der|en|fro|chapitre}}, from {{der|en|la|capitulum||a chapter of a book, in Medieval Latin also a synod or council}}, diminutive of {{m|la|caput||a head}}; see {{doublet|en|capital|capitulum|chapiter|notext=1}}, which are doublets of ''chapter''.

